1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,500
An original React Three Fiber demonstration by Lex from SigmaStudioz.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:11,500
One deterministic model supplies the scene, its controls and the exported film.

3
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:19,000
Arrivals rise from 2 to 5 items/s against 3 items/s service. At 16 seconds arrivals fall to 1; the queue clears at 19.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Original geometry and shaders react to the measured soundtrack envelope; no reference media is reused.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Interactive and film views sample the same state and time. The authored export renders at 60 frames per second.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:36,000
SigmaStudioz Visualizer. Interactive visuals and visualization videos. By Lex from SigmaStudioz.
